                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Oh how I crave for a good oil tycoon game. \nBut this isn´t it. \nJust a small scale game for children, at best.\nNot much to do or manage at all. You build a pump, a refinery, storage tank, some logistics like export pumps, repair-crew and security. That´s it. You sell your oil and repeat. More money, more pumps, more refineries... not much happening here at all.",
